  "question": {
    "text": "Consider all possible isomeric ketones, including stereoisomers of MW = 100. All these isomers are independently reacted with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> (NOTE: stereoisomers are also reacted separately). The total number of ketones that give a racemic product(s) is/are"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The general formula of isomeric ketone having molecular mass 100 is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo> </mo><mo>[</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>12</mn><mo> </mo><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn><mo> </mo><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>]</mo></math>.</p><p>1] Will not give a racemic mixture on reduction with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math>. </p><p>this  ketone have chiral center will give diastereoisomer.<br/><img src=\"assets\\st0017_e5944667a272.jpg\"/><br >2] Will give a racemic mixture on reduction with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br ><img src=\"assets\\st0017_5222bfc5adab.jpg\"/><br >3] Will give a racemic mixture on reduction with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br ><img src=\"assets\\st0017_c579feec6cde.jpg\"/><br >4] Will give a racemic mixture on reduction with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br ><img src=\"assets\\st0017_e0cd63f80e93.jpg\"/><br/>5] Will give a racemic mixture on reduction with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br ><img src=\"assets\\st0017_adfac0eaa932.jpg\"/><br >6] Will give a racemic mixture on reduction with <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math><br ><img src=\"assets\\st0017_552ab6d87893.jpg\"/></p>"
